# Build switches read by `autophys build-web`. Copy to html/.env (gitignored)
# to change them for your own builds; the build's environment overrides it.
#
# TENTO_APP_SWITCHER: `on` bundles the Lona family app switcher into the
# header (the chevron after the Autophys mark) from html/app-switcher.json,
# also gitignored. Off by default, so a clone of this repository builds
# without it. Lona's hosted builds (autophys.lona.so, dev--autophys.lona.so)
# set it to `on` and copy html/app-switcher.json byte for byte from tento's
# generated Lona preset, tento-brand-lona-js/family/lona-switcher.json: the
# apps in grid order with their tiles inline, the chevron's label, the
# studio.lona.so footer link and the light and dark colour tokens. After the
# family changes, copy it again rather than editing it. A clone has neither
# file and builds with no switcher and no Lona data; with the switch on and
# no manifest, nothing is bundled either.
#
# tento-web's bundler (vendor/tento/tento-web-js/build-plugins/app-switcher.deno.ts)
# reads both files during the build and replaces
# @tento-brand/kit/app-switcher.packaged with the result;
# html/routes/app-switcher.ts mounts it on the header's brand link.
# TENTO_APP_SWITCHER=on
